{
  "extension": "gallery",
  "note": "Ordered by how much of the shared treatment a component carries, since gallery groups by similarity: the wall of identically treated surfaces first, because that IS the mechanism and it has to be seen repeating before anything else; then what a cell holds, then the text that names it, then the controls that filter it, then the marks, and the overlays that leave the wall entirely last.",
